  </StreamGeometry>
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="FilterGroupCaseGeometry">
    M1.5,12 L4,3 H6 L8.5,12 H6.7 L6.2,10 H3.8 L3.3,12 Z M4.3,8.2 H5.7 L5,5.2 Z M9.2,12 V7.2 C9.2,5.6 10.2,4.8 11.7,4.8 C13.1,4.8 14,5.5 14,6.9 V12 H12.5 V7.4 C12.5,6.6 12.1,6.2 11.5,6.2 C10.9,6.2 10.5,6.6 10.5,7.4 V12 Z
